  type_routine_err_duplicate_param.pcpp - break step of type_routine.pcpp:
  two parameters of one routine type share a name (SM0004)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_routine_err_duplicate_param.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_routine_err_duplicate_param.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
